<title>THAILAND: Securities One pays 0.60 baht H2 dividend.</title>
<headline>Securities One pays 0.60 baht H2 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for second half ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			    Six months</p>
<p>    Dividend (baht)   0.60   vs    2.25</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 4, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	N.A.</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Securities One Plc, finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
